# Legacy Archive Governance

- `_legacy_archive/` is reference-only. Do not import from it, modify it, or treat it as runtime truth.
- If a legacy artifact seems useful, record it in `docs-governance/archive/SCHEMA_ARCHAEOLOGY.md` (archived — reference only) or another governed review doc outside the archive.
- Any valuable concept from legacy materials must be re-derived through current registries and contracts, not copied directly.
- Compare historical concepts against:
  - `docs-governance/canonical/SCHEMA_ANCHOR_REGISTRY.md`
  - `docs-governance/archive/DOMAIN_CONCEPT_REGISTRY.md` (archived — reference only)
  - `registry-yaml/`
